---
description: TypeScript coding standards and type safety guidelines
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---
- Enable strict mode in tsconfig.json for enhanced type checking.
- Use readonly arrays and tuples where appropriate to prevent unintended mutations.
- Leverage utility types (e.g., Partial, Readonly, Pick) for more flexible type definitions.
- Implement custom type guards for runtime type checking and narrowing.